cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark suite or its measurement data, please cite the paper below."
title: "Benchmark suite and data for An Architectural Performance Evaluation of Post-Quantum and Classical Digital Signature Algorithms on x86 and ARM"
abstract: >-
  C benchmark harnesses, shell drivers, raw measurement data and analysis
  scripts for a cross-architecture evaluation of ML-DSA, SLH-DSA and Falcon
  against RSA-3072 and ECDSA-P256 on x86_64 and AArch64.
